        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Place cards strategically to create a thriving city, balancing resources like Wheat, Meat,  Metal, and Products. <strong>And u</strong>pgrade your city with houses, shops, and factories to boost resource production and create powerful combos.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/ddf7aef4721ef6ea767ce5ab68a4032f.poster.avif?t=1789053526\" width=1170 height=780 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/ddf7aef4721ef6ea767ce5ab68a4032f.webm?t=1789053526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/ddf7aef4721ef6ea767ce5ab68a4032f.mp4?t=1789053526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each item is then multiplied with it's price and collect money at the end of the day.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/a53bec32b99fe78960417c6b83df1c9a.poster.avif?t=1789053526\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/a53bec32b99fe78960417c6b83df1c9a.webm?t=1789053526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/a53bec32b99fe78960417c6b83df1c9a.mp4?t=1789053526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Buy cards from a shop or select random rewards after each level to customize your deck and refine your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And unlock powerful global upgrades that enhance your abilities and provide game-changing effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/eaf0a9e44de8a088a232483281376453.poster.avif?t=1789053526\" width=1170 height=780 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/eaf0a9e44de8a088a232483281376453.webm?t=1789053526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/eaf0a9e44de8a088a232483281376453.mp4?t=1789053526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the balance between resource generation, economic growth, and powerful upgrades to expand your city and unlock new challenges. Will you build the ultimate city?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Place cards strategically to create a thriving city, balancing resources like Wheat, Meat,  Metal, and Products. <strong>And u</strong>pgrade your city with houses, shops, and factories to boost resource production and create powerful combos.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/ddf7aef4721ef6ea767ce5ab68a4032f.poster.avif?t=1789053526\" width=1170 height=780 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/ddf7aef4721ef6ea767ce5ab68a4032f.webm?t=1789053526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/ddf7aef4721ef6ea767ce5ab68a4032f.mp4?t=1789053526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each item is then multiplied with it's price and collect money at the end of the day.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/a53bec32b99fe78960417c6b83df1c9a.poster.avif?t=1789053526\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/a53bec32b99fe78960417c6b83df1c9a.webm?t=1789053526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/a53bec32b99fe78960417c6b83df1c9a.mp4?t=1789053526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Buy cards from a shop or select random rewards after each level to customize your deck and refine your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And unlock powerful global upgrades that enhance your abilities and provide game-changing effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/eaf0a9e44de8a088a232483281376453.poster.avif?t=1789053526\" width=1170 height=780 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/eaf0a9e44de8a088a232483281376453.webm?t=1789053526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/eaf0a9e44de8a088a232483281376453.mp4?t=1789053526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the balance between resource generation, economic growth, and powerful upgrades to expand your city and unlock new challenges. Will you build the ultimate city?</p>",
